Section: firmware
SourceDateEpoch: 1778288009
Architecture: arm_cortex-a7_neon-vfpv4
Installed-Size: 9005
Filename: ipq-wifi-buffalo_wxr-5950ax12_2023-11-10-0c2e810e-1_arm_cortex-a7_neon-vfpv4.ipk
Size: 9609
SHA256sum: af838ffe83acb2dd08df32d90083084626a0ed9ce92e428c1b5c0e5fbaeb9846
Description:  The Buffalo WXR-5950AX12 requires board-specific, reference ("cal") data
 that is not yet present in the upstream wireless firmware distribution.
 
 This package supplies board-2.bin file(s) that, in the interim,
 overwrite those supplied by the ath10k-firmware-* packages.
 
 This is package is only necessary for the Buffalo WXR-5950AX12.
 
 Do not install it for any other device!

